<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.19 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.44 vs   1.80</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.40 vs   0.56</p>
<p> Sales		    7.21 vs   7.59</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.18 vs   5.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.48 vs  10.10</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.62 vs   6.86</p>
<p> Sales		   71.32 vs  63.55</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
